              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hS2DZ",
                  "name": "Connectivity and interruptions heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Connectivity and interruptions",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BtLof",
                  "name": "Connectivity and interruptions content",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "OFFLINE / STALE\nDo not imply listing availability or price is freshly checked without network.\n\nMONEY OR ORDER ACTION\nClearly distinguish pending, confirmed and failed. Prevent duplicate submissions.\n\nINTERRUPTION\nPreserve safe text and progress across backgrounding and transient network loss.\n\nUNKNOWN RESULT\nReconcile server/provider state before enabling a retry. Offline handoff security still needs architecture verification.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
