                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r81xCZ",
                  "name": "Hierarchy content",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "FOUNDATIONS\nApproved tokens, type, spacing, radii, motion.\n\nPRIMITIVES\nButtons · fields · selection · badges · alerts · media · dividers.\n\nCOMPOSITES\nListing card · price block · form group · chat · timeline · code entry.\n\nPATTERNS\nAuthentication · verification · filters · checkout · handoff · cancellation.\n\nTEMPLATES\nBrowse · detail · form · order · chat · seller workspace · staff queue.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "BXXPv",
              "name": "Marketplace components",
              "width": 250,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lRzbB",
                  "name": "Marketplace components heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Marketplace components",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "m2FtQ4",
                  "name": "Marketplace components content",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "LISTING CARD\nActive · unavailable/openable · sold/un-clickable · saved.\n\nPRODUCT DETAIL\nPhotos · facts · condition · price · negotiable state · seller status · report.\n\nPRICE SUMMARY\nNormal/effective/accepted price · courier fee · total · held/refund/proceeds state.\n\nSEARCH + FILTERS\nCampus-scoped collection, results, no results and recovery.\n\nNever let a visual state bypass availability, campus scope or purchase locks.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "B70ZH",
              "name": "Transaction components",
              "width": 250,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "n6rvn",
                  "name": "Transaction components heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Transaction components",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fy4rZ",
                  "name": "Transaction components content",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "ORDER TIMELINE\nPayment pending → paid → ready → booking/assignment → in transit → received → dispute window → final outcome.\n\nHANDOFF CODE\nSix digits · validation error · offline pending sync · validated.\n\nCOORDINATION\nBooking, courier status/contact and blocked/read-only state.\n\nMessages, alerts and feedback communicate server state only. Courier collection is not buyer receipt.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "lcafa",
              "name": "Trust, account and staff",
              "width": 250,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "saCNj",
                  "name": "Trust, account and staff heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Trust, account and staff",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LrDGz",
                  "name": "Trust, account and staff content",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "SELLER VERIFICATION\nChoose-one proof · private upload · draft/resubmit · 2FA gate.\n\nMESSAGING\nNegotiable pre-purchase · paid-order · read-only archive. No global inbox or photo attachments.\n\nSELLER WORKSPACE\nDrafts · active/sold/unlisted · queue · proceeds.\n\nSTAFF QUEUE\nCase/order collection · detail · decision form · audit history. Mobile retains full completion.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "csojk",
              "name": "States and platform rule",
              "width": 250,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uHLp9",
                  "name": "States and platform rule heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "States and platform rule",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Vtn3T",
                  "name": "States and platform rule content",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "GLOBAL STATES\nDefault · focus · pressed · disabled · pending · success · validation/general error · empty · offline/stale · long content · read-only.\n\nACCESSIBILITY\nPersistent labels · clear errors · visible focus · text scaling · 44 pt iOS / 48 dp Android targets.\n\nPLATFORM\nShared meaning, product rules and content. iOS/Android may use their own navigation, sheet/menu, keyboard and system-bar conventions.\n\nScreen files begin at Step 08; this canvas remains canonical.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
