          "fontWeight": "bold"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "TLx2w",
          "name": "Interaction patterns columns",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fill_container",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "w5vQJw",
              "name": "Feedback contract",
              "width": 250,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BtAYg",
                  "name": "Feedback contract heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "content": "Feedback contract",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "c7JRy2",
                  "name": "Feedback contract detail",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "READY\nShow state, eligibility, next actor/action and deadline.\n\nSUBMITTING\nShow progress; prevent duplicate consequential actions.\n\nPENDING / UNKNOWN\nName the check in progress; block dependent actions; reconcile before retry.\n\nCONFIRMED\nState only a server/provider-confirmed outcome.\n\nFAILURE\nExplain what failed, what was retained, and a safe next step.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Q9F6W",
              "name": "Signup, browse, negotiate",
              "width": 250,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lJaio",
                  "name": "Signup, browse, negotiate heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "content": "Signup, browse, negotiate",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "l3yh5",
                  "name": "Signup, browse, negotiate detail",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "SIGNUP\nTerms + Privacy · 18+ checkbox · university · required campus · email verification before entry.\n\nDISCOVERY\nKeep campus context visible; mark stale data; explain empty results.\n\nDETAIL\nOrder starts from the product detail. Fixed-price listings have no pre-buy chat.\n\nNEGOTIATION\nOnly for negotiable listings. Accepted price is buyer-specific for 90 minutes; show expiry and checkout.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "m5dnS",
              "name": "Checkout and readiness",
              "width": 250,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wmBan",
                  "name": "Checkout and readiness heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "content": "Checkout and readiness",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y0xlr",
                  "name": "Checkout and readiness detail",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "CHECKOUT\nReview item, fee, total, campus, fulfilment and destination.\n\nPAYMENT\nProvider redirect is not confirmation. Unknown result stays pending until reconciled.\n\nSELLER READY\nShow six-hour deadline, four-hour grace and ten-hour auto-cancel/refund consequence.\n\nFULFILMENT\nMeetup booking or manually assigned courier; show next actor, buyer window and directions.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "RStxF",
              "name": "Handoff, dispute, refund",
              "width": 250,
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#C5CEBF",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "U1KR2q",
                  "name": "Handoff, dispute, refund heading",
                  "fill": "#1F2B21",
                  "content": "Handoff, dispute, refund",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fbQ11",
                  "name": "Handoff, dispute, refund detail",
                  "fill": "#4E5D4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "HANDOFF\nBuyer inspects and enters six-digit order code. Courier collection is not receipt.\n\nOFFLINE\nSaved-for-sync is pending; no Received state or dispute timer until server validates.\n\nDISPUTE\n36-hour window · eligible reasons + evidence · seller 18h · Support 12h target.\n\nRETURN / REFUND\nOriginal method, separate return code, fault outcome; refund remains pending until provider confirms.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
