                  "content": "PRESERVE WORK\nKeep safe form/chat input across errors and interruptions.\n\nBLOCKED\nSay what condition is unmet and what can resolve it.\n\nREAD-ONLY\nKeep history visible; explain why editing is closed.\n\nSTAFF\nShow assigned case, evidence, allowed decision, resulting funds state and audit outcome.\n\nACCESSIBILITY\nText states, visible focus, reflow, reduced motion; never rely on color or animation alone.",
